(7828,1,5,'Show them the might of Revantusk!',15595),
(7829,1,0,'Clear your head of impure thoughts, $r. Become one with the wilds!',15595),
(7830,1,0,'The Razorbeak Skylord is a much rarer breed of gryphon: One responsible for mating and creating murderous offspring.',15595),
(7831,1,0,'Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks!  By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal.  Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Orgrimmar, I assure you!$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',15595),
