(8276,1,0,'',15595),
(8277,1,0,'Are you done collecting those samples?  We could lose Noggle any minute now!',15595),
(8278,1,0,'This is our last chance to save Noggle!  Hurry!',15595),
(8279,0,0,'Who goes there?  Oh, it\'s you!  Did you find all the Lexicon chapters yet?',15595),
(8280,1,0,'The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!',15595),
(8281,1,0,'The dredge crushers are a serious threat and must be dealt with at once!',15595),
(8282,0,0,'Still haven\'t found my bag?  Well I should count my lucky stars, at least the poison\'s been cleansed.',15595),
(8283,1,0,'I\'ll need the creature\'s pincer as proof of the deed.  No pincer, no reward.',15595),
(8284,1,0,'The ravaged camp can be found northwest of here.  Come back when you have all the fragments.',15595),
(8285,1,0,'You!  How did you find me?  Who are you?  You weren\'t followed, were you?  Speak!',15595),
(8286,1,6,'Has Anachronos returned?',15595),
(8287,1,0,'What is this you bring to me, $N?',15595),
(8288,1,0,'It is the favor of the Brood of Nozdormu that you must earn.',15595),
(8301,1,0,'There is much history rooted IN their distrust of the mortal races; but alas, such is a tale better left for the Brood to tell when the time is right.',15595),
(8302,1,0,'Perhaps one day the whole of Cenarion Hold will be workINg under your command.',15595),
(8303,1,0,'',15595),
(8304,1,5,'Waste no time, $N!',15595),
(8305,1,0,'',15595),
