(8307,1,0,'',15595),
(8308,1,0,'Oh dear.',15595),
(8309,1,0,'If you find some crazy night elf lass in there, be sure to give her a kick in the duff.',15595),
(8310,1,0,'Go play with the monkey, kid. I don\'t have time for this. ',15595),
(8312,1,0,'Have you finished trick-or-treating yet?  I\'m sad that I can\'t go because I\'m sick, but you helping me out makes me feel a little better...',15595),
(8313,1,0,'Did you learn the recipe?  You won\'t keep it to yourself, I hope!',15595),
(8314,1,0,'Oh my! What do you have there, $N?',15595),
(8315,1,0,'You must take the opportunity as it presents itself and strike!',15595),
(8317,1,0,'How are those dumplings coming along? ',15595),
(8318,1,0,'Did you bring me some texts?',15595),
(8319,1,0,'Keep bringing me texts.  We\'ll soon force the Twilight\'s Hammer out of Silithus.',15595),
(8320,1,0,'Enter the desert and find the Twilight geolords, $N. Return to me after they are slain.',15595),
(8321,6,0,'$N, have you yet defeated Vyral the Vile?  Do you have his signet ring?',15595),
(8323,1,0,'Did you find any encrypted texts?  I\'m quite curious to read this month\'s True Believer.',15595),
(8324,0,0,'Find any more encrypted texts? Bring me a good batch of them, this decoding work takes some time.',15595),
(8325,1,0,'Our work in rebuilding our society begins here, $N. Once we are able to secure our home, we can look outward and upward.',15595),
(8326,0,0,'It gives me no pleasure to ask you to destroy these beasts.  While in times past we have lived in relative harmony with woodland creatures, these are different times.  The first order of business for all sin\'dorei is survival; make sure you remember that.',20779),
(8327,1,0,NULL,15595),
(8328,1,0,NULL,15595),
(8330,1,1,'Have you had a chance to find my belongings?  Once we reassert our dominance over Sunstrider Isle, I will need them in my work.  For now though, I must maintain my watch over the Sunwell... or what remains of it.',15595),
(8331,1,0,NULL,15595),
(8332,1,0,'Do you have the shard and the crests, Demonhound? I will need them to make the twilight cultist\'s medallion of station.',15595),
(8333,0,0,'If you need another Twilight cultist\'s medallion of station, then I am happy to oblige. I will, however, need another brilliant shard and some abyssal crests...',15595),
(8334,1,25,'It is better you learn about survival - and the costs of survival - now rather than later. Making hard choices is something you\'re going to have to get used to as a blood elf.$B$BNo one was there for us when the Scourge ripped our home in two. It was us and us alone who pulled ourselves up by the bootstraps.',15595),
(8335,1,0,'Heed well this warning - Felendren the Banished is only a symptom of a much larger problem.  His demise will solve our immediate concerns, but all blood elves share the potential same fate as him if we let our addictions get the best of us.',20779),
(8336,1,0,'Many of the creatures here on the isle were at one point bound into non-aggression and complacency by our magical skills.  When the Scourge destroyed the Sunwell, our hold over these creatures shattered.  Arcane slivers are the remnants of the control we once had, and as such might be usable in fashioning a new device to aid us in regaining their control.$B$BBetter still, perhaps the slivers could be used to see what malaise the isle truly suffers under...',15595),
(8341,1,0,'Do you have the shards and the signets, $N? I will need them to create the ring of lordship. ',15595),
(8342,0,0,'$N, if you plan to go after the Abyssal High Council again, then you\'ll need another Twilight ring of lordship. Bring me more shards and signets and I\'ll make one for you.',15595),
(8343,1,0,NULL,15595),
(8345,1,0,'Have you read the plaque on the shrine then, $c?',15595),
