(8886,1,0,'I am grateful for the assistance of someone like you, $N. It almost puts a smile on my face. But then I realize what these monsters have done to my ship and what\'s happening to Quel\'Thalas.$B$BHave you managed to retrieve any of my cargo?',15595),
(8887,1,0,'Hello, $c, you\'re a sight for sore eyes. I know, it\'s crazy for me to be here, what with the anchorage overrun by the Wretched. Velendris and his rangers have sworn to protect me on the condition that I get out of here as soon as I\'ve recovered my cargo.$B$BWhat\'s that you have there... it looks vaguely familiar?',15595),
