(8994,1,0,'We\'ve come a long way, $N, and I just wanted to say that no matter what happens, thank you! You\'ve put yourself in mortal danger to try to help the surviving members of our mercenary company, The Veiled Blade, and as far as I\'m concerned, you\'re one of us now.',15595),
