(9121,1,0,'None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.',15595),
(9122,1,0,'None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.',15595),
(9123,1,0,'None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.',15595),
(9124,1,0,'How goes the hunt?',15595),
(9125,1,0,'You did an exemplary job on the first bundle, $n. If you have more, I will take them now. For every bundle that you turn in, I will reward you with another insignia.',15595),
(9126,1,0,'I can direct you to skeleton infested locales, $c.',15595),
(9127,1,0,'A man in my line of work can never have too many bone fragments, $n. Whenever you have a surplus of fragments, bring them to me and I\'ll reward you with another insignia.',15595),
(9128,1,0,'I can only steer you in the right direction, $N.',15595),
(9129,1,0,'Truth be told, I use the cores to create Frostfire armor. It is the armor used by the mages battling in Naxxramas. Without you and others like you, we would most definitely be losing this war.$B$BWith that said, bring me more cores and I shall grant you more insignias.\n',15595),
(9130,1,0,'Yes, what\'s this?',15595),
(9131,1,0,'<Korfax growls at you.>$B$BWhat do you want? Directions? I can provide those...',15595),
(9132,25,0,'For every armful of the scraps, I\'ll give you an insignia - the more the better. Now get out of my sight before I split you in two!\n',15595),
(9133,1,0,'That\'s quite a list you have there, friend.  Let me take a look at it.',15595),
(9134,1,0,'Wow, that box of goods you have there looks heavy!  You want to load that up on one of my flying beauties?',15595),
(9135,1,0,'$C, back so soon?  That doesn\'t look like everything I requested...',15595),
(9136,6,2,'I have intimate knowledge of the flora in our world. Do you require direction?',15595),
(9137,1,2,'For every bundle of fronds that you deliver to me, I will pay you with your choice of an insignia of the Dawn or the Crusade.$b$bInsignias may be turned in to the Quartermaster for various rewards.',15595),
(9138,1,0,'With your aid we\'ll get the Scourge problem contained, $c. Dar\'Khan will be dealt with!$B$BHave you handled the nerubian problem at Suncrown Village yet?',15595),
(9139,1,0,'I\'ve learned much about fighting the Scourge in the time that I\'ve been here. They can be beaten back, but it must be done in small steps. The obscene manner in which they can take your fallen and add them to their own ranks as the newly risen makes it imperative that you make no mistakes along the way.$B$BNow, how goes the fight against Goldenmist Village?',15595),
(9140,1,0,'$C, has Windrunner Village been liberated? Those damned magisters at the Sanctum of the Sun have been berating me to get their hands on those Scourge remnants I asked you to gather.$B$BDon\'t worry about that, though. You take your time and get the job done right. I\'ll deal with the magisters.',15595),
(9141,6,0,'<Commander Metz chews on his cigar.>$B$BWhat is it? I\'m a busy man.',15595),
